<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1337296869"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1496349182"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Million Dollar Mood"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="WEALTHYSELF / Miranda Glory / CANCUN?"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Million Dollar Mood"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:40.560"><div begin="00:00.980" end="02:40.620"><p begin="00:00.980" end="00:04.650" itunes:key="L1">Too big for this little town<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个小城市容不下我们的雄心抱负</span></p><p begin="00:04.650" end="00:08.190" itunes:key="L2">Thank God that we made it out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感谢上帝 我们成功了</span></p><p begin="00:08.190" end="00:11.840" itunes:key="L3">Just us, we don't follow crowds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们特立独行 不随大流</span></p><p begin="00:11.840" end="00:15.020" itunes:key="L4">Rich thoughts, they're too big to count<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的想法价值千金 数不胜数</span></p><p begin="00:15.020" end="00:18.500" itunes:key="L5">I thought I told you, I thought I did<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我告诉过你</span></p><p begin="00:18.500" end="00:22.240" itunes:key="L6">Paycheck to paycheck's no way to live<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们根本不会入不敷出 钱多到花不完</span></p><p begin="00:22.240" end="00:25.840" itunes:key="L7">Our love is gold, but won't pay the bills<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱非常珍贵 但不必付出任何代价</span></p><p begin="00:25.840" end="00:28.720" itunes:key="L8">I thought I told you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我告诉过你</span></p><p begin="00:28.720" end="00:31.720" itunes:key="L9">I'm in a million-dollar mood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心情超好 就像中了一百万</span></p><p begin="00:31.720" end="00:35.330" itunes:key="L10">Hit the lotto and I'll spend it all with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">中了彩票 我要和你一起肆意挥霍</span></p><p begin="00:35.330" end="00:38.910" itunes:key="L11">Bet on us 'cause I ain't got nothing to lose<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信我们 反正我们本来就一无所有</span></p><p begin="00:38.910" end="00:41.120" itunes:key="L12">We're just burning through our dollars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就这样肆无忌惮地挥霍钱财</span></p><p begin="00:41.120" end="00:44.290" itunes:key="L13">Tryna fix our problems, they say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要解决我们的烦恼 他们说</span></p><p begin="00:44.290" end="00:47.950" itunes:key="L14">"Time is money," so we don't waste time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间就是金钱 所以我们不能浪费时间</span></p><p begin="00:47.950" end="00:51.490" itunes:key="L15">Call us crazy, we don't pay no mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管叫我们疯子吧 我们要彻夜狂欢</span></p><p begin="00:51.490" end="00:55.120" itunes:key="L16">Feelin' something that they just can't buy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种感觉千金难换</span></p><p begin="00:55.120" end="00:56.700" itunes:key="L17">Call me crazy, but<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管叫我疯子吧</span></p><p begin="00:56.700" end="00:59.110" itunes:key="L18">I'm in a million-dollar mood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心情超好 就像中了一百万</span></p><p begin="01:12.740" end="01:14.500" itunes:key="L19">Shining, I look like a lighthouse<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就像灯塔一样明亮</span></p><p begin="01:14.500" end="01:16.380" itunes:key="L20">Running like we in the White House<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肆意奔跑 仿佛我们住进了白宫</span></p><p begin="01:16.380" end="01:18.200" itunes:key="L21">We do not look at the price now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们现在不在乎价格</span></p><p begin="01:18.200" end="01:20.370" itunes:key="L22">We do not look at the price now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们现在不在乎价格</span></p><p begin="01:20.370" end="01:21.840" itunes:key="L23">Every day you're shopping<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每天你都在疯狂血拼</span></p><p begin="01:21.840" end="01:23.940" itunes:key="L24">They gon' say we do the most<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们会说我们的行为不可思议</span></p><p begin="01:23.940" end="01:25.790" itunes:key="L25">Swag me on a million dollars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给我无限的财富吧</span></p><p begin="01:25.790" end="01:27.200" itunes:key="L26">So, we have a boat<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样我们就能买一条船</span></p><p begin="01:27.200" end="01:30.690" itunes:key="L27">I thought I told you, I thought I did<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我告诉过你</span></p><p begin="01:30.690" end="01:34.280" itunes:key="L28">Paycheck to paycheck's no way to live<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们根本不会入不敷出 钱多到花不完</span></p><p begin="01:34.280" end="01:37.950" itunes:key="L29">Our love is gold, but won't pay the bills<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱非常珍贵 但不必付出任何代价</span></p><p begin="01:37.950" end="01:40.870" itunes:key="L30">I thought I told you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我告诉过你</span></p><p begin="01:40.870" end="01:43.900" itunes:key="L31">I'm in a million-dollar mood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心情超好 就像中了一百万</span></p><p begin="01:43.900" end="01:47.540" itunes:key="L32">Hit the lotto and I'll spend it all with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">中了彩票 我要和你一起肆意挥霍</span></p><p begin="01:47.540" end="01:51.010" itunes:key="L33">Bet on us 'cause I ain't got nothing to lose<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信我们 反正我们本来就一无所有</span></p><p begin="01:51.010" end="01:53.380" itunes:key="L34">We're just burning through our dollars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就这样肆无忌惮地挥霍钱财</span></p><p begin="01:53.380" end="01:56.490" itunes:key="L35">Tryna fix our problems, they say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要解决我们的烦恼 他们说</span></p><p begin="01:56.490" end="02:00.150" itunes:key="L36">"Time is money", so we don't waste time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间就是金钱 所以我们不能浪费时间</span></p><p begin="02:00.150" end="02:03.760" itunes:key="L37">Call us crazy, we don't pay no mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管叫我们疯子吧 我们要彻夜狂欢</span></p><p begin="02:03.760" end="02:07.270" itunes:key="L38">Feelin' something that they just can't buy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种感觉千金难换</span></p><p begin="02:07.270" end="02:08.890" itunes:key="L39">Call me crazy, but<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管叫我疯子吧</span></p><p begin="02:08.890" end="02:11.970" itunes:key="L40">I'm in a million-dollar mood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心情超好 就像中了一百万</span></p><p begin="02:23.320" end="02:24.920" itunes:key="L41">I'm in a million-dollar mood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心情超好 就像中了一百万</span></p><p begin="02:24.920" end="02:28.650" itunes:key="L42">(I thought I told you, I thought I did)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我告诉过你</span></p><p begin="02:28.650" end="02:32.180" itunes:key="L43">(Paycheck to paycheck's no way to live)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们根本不会入不敷出 钱多到花不完</span></p><p begin="02:32.180" end="02:35.840" itunes:key="L44">(Our love is gold, but won't pay the bills)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的爱非常珍贵 但不必付出任何代价</span></p><p begin="02:35.840" end="02:37.840" itunes:key="L45">(I thought I told you)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我以为我告诉过你</span></p><p begin="02:37.840" end="02:40.620" itunes:key="L46">I'm in a million-dollar mood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心情超好 就像中了一百万</span></p></div></body></tt>